source="WinEventLog:Security" EventCode=4625

| bin _time span=60s
| stats count as event_count by _time IpAddress

| search event_count >= 5

| multisearch
[ search source="WinEventLog:Security" EventCode=4625

| bin _time span=60s
| stats count as event_count by _time IpAddress

| search event_count >= 5 | eval event_type="win_bruteforce_single_source" ]
[ search source="WinEventLog:Security" EventCode=4624 | eval event_type="win_security_logon_success" ]

| bin _time span=2m
| stats dc(event_type) as event_type_count by _time IpAddress

| search event_type_count >= 2
